{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35183","headline":"白石潭秋霁作 · 周繇","name":"白石潭秋霁作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"潭心烟雾破斜晖，殷殷雷声隔翠微。\n崖蹙盘涡翻蜃窟，滩吹白石上渔矶。\n陵风舴艋讴哑去，出水鸬鷀薄泊飞。\n秋霁更谁同此望，远钟时见一僧归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周繇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35183.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35183","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}